    text: "`Coroutine<In, Out>` takes two type arguments, the input type and the output type. The functions of `std/coroutine` are called through the module and are not imported by name.\nFix: write both type arguments, and use `import * as Co from \"std/coroutine\"` with `Co.resume`.",
